  "conclusion": "Actual59.2.0 APIs support the dictionary design: StringArray uses i32 byte offsets, usize entry count; nonempty nonnegative nondecreasing offsets; valid-key bounds against values.len(); all-null keys accepted; string slice/UTF-8 checks remain. No new i32 entry-count ceiling. Source claims stand; dependency-provenance wording is corrected."
}
